    "created_at": "2017-12-04T13:51:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-12-04T13:51:59Z",
    "body": "Indeed the spec doesn't copy internal state. I don't know if that should change. Are there any known web compat issues?\r\n\r\nThe 1.2 step I tried to model after Gecko I believe. See https://github.com/ResponsiveImagesCG/picture-element/commit/ee685075cd65f02022d74b7932073fda4102d15f\r\n\r\nIn particular before that change the algorithm would just abort if the document is not active, and then nothing would happen when the document became active. But there could be better ways to specify that logic.",
